#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; is a simple graphical front-end to Simond. It creates and "
"displays a tray-icon from which you can start and stop the Simond server. "
"Moreover it provides a configuration dialog in which it embeds the Simond "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "KSimond can be configured to be started on KDE start."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please report any problems or feature requests to <ulink url=\"http://"
"sourceforge.net/tracker/?group_id=190872\">our bug tracker</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kappname;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Due to its minimalistic nature KSimond itself does not even have an "
"application window. However, the tray icon has a context menu from where you "
"can start and stop Simond and also open the configuration."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "screenshot of &kappname;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "KSimond \"screenshot\""
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"KSimond has the ability to launch automatically when KDE starts and to "
"handle unexpected Simond crashes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "screenshot of the &kappname;-configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "KSimond configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please note that the option to start KSimond at login will work on both "
"Microsoft Windows and when you are using KDE on Linux. Support for other "
"desktop environments like Gnome, XFCE, etc. might require manually placing "
"KSimond in the session autostart (please refer to the respective manuals of "
"your desktop environment)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alongside the KSimond configuration the Simond configuration modules are "
"listed (also available through systemsettings). See the <ulink url=\"help:/"
"simond\">Simond manual</ulink> for details."
msgstr ""

